  "col_right L15: «Mā-shā’-Allāh» has bars over the a's and the sign of hamza. «Μασάλα» is Greek, read at 6,000 dpi: the acute on the second α is cast joined to the letter. The V of «{sc:xliv}» is printed broken.",
